#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:1 d68ea43b05e247cab630db2b2914900c
msgid "添加新模型"
msgstr "Adding a new model"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:3 cf6470dc728c45abab98e2e78e215cd4
msgid ""
"本指南演示如何为 UniKT 添加一个新模型，使之能被 ``python train.py -m MyModel -d "
"assistments09`` 直接调用。"
msgstr ""
"This guide demonstrates how to add a new model to UniKT so that it can be "
"invoked directly via ``python train.py -m MyModel -d assistments09``."

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:5 dec8e6efe3a64fd6854a0de2fb47a686
msgid "步骤一：创建模型目录结构"
msgstr "Step 1: Create the model directory structure"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:7 6c93f1bb4bcc40868184058f701cfb46
msgid "每个模型在 ``model/`` 下拥有独立目录，含三个必需文件和一个可选文件。以 GIKT 为例："
msgstr ""
"Each model has its own directory under ``model/`` containing three required "
"files and one optional file. Using GIKT as an example:"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:17 4436ccd3d3d54cd198dc10ab0cc3be96
msgid ""
"注册由 ``model/__init__.py`` 统一的 ``discover_registrations`` 完成，子包 "
"``__init__.py`` 留空即可。"
msgstr ""
"Registration is handled centrally by ``discover_registrations`` in "
"``model/__init__.py``; leave the subpackage ``__init__.py`` empty."

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:19 fd826bf3945a463683a9ac32a81892cc
msgid "步骤二：实现 Trainer"
msgstr "Step 2: Implement the trainer"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:21 89ea9c45adca4576aef4c381a705e45e
msgid "Trainer 需完成三件事：准备数据、初始化模型、定义 ``forward_pass``。"
msgstr ""
"The trainer must do three things: prepare the data, initialize the model, "
"and define ``forward_pass``."

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:25 c6558759b40843d6928544c11965b460
msgid "2.1 准备数据"
msgstr "2.1 Prepare the data"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:27 d706e2efee524f47b8ad5fd2868944c4
msgid ""
"根据数据粒度选择基类：**``SkillModelData``**（KC 级，如 DKT、AKT、SimpleKT）使用 "
"``build_sequence_data``；**``QuestionModelData``**（题目级，如 "
"GIKT、HDHKT、SGKT）使用 ``load_sequence_data``。两者均通过 ``split_kfold_data`` "
"划分训练/验证/测试集。"
msgstr ""
"Choose a base class based on data granularity: **``SkillModelData``** "
"(KC-level, e.g. DKT, AKT, SimpleKT) uses ``build_sequence_data``; "
"**``QuestionModelData``** (question-level, e.g. GIKT, HDHKT, SGKT) uses "
"``load_sequence_data``. Both split the data into train/validation/test sets "
"via ``split_kfold_data``."

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:36 5a72c10eb1314b3fa5523eda4d043f79
msgid ""
"若需自定义 collate_fn（如 GIKT 在 batch 内构建邻居索引），通过 ``with_data(collate_fn=...)``"
" 传入。"
msgstr ""
"If you need a custom collate_fn (e.g. GIKT builds neighbor indices within a "
"batch), pass it in via ``with_data(collate_fn=...)``."

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:40 72589bf634714b6e809bcb695200fa29
msgid "2.2 初始化模型与链式构建"
msgstr "2.2 Initialize the model and build the chain"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:81 6dbb08d03cb142c8a9a8c55650230437
msgid "四个 ``with_*`` 必须全部调用，否则 ``build`` 抛 ``ValueError``。"
msgstr ""
"All four ``with_*`` methods must be called, otherwise ``build`` raises a "
"``ValueError``."

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:86 51f4509848da4297bce91bb8e0d0f0da
msgid "2.3 实现 forward_pass"
msgstr "2.3 Implement forward_pass"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:88 bb6ef5279cae4988ba1be2c45e6db5b1
msgid "``forward_pass`` 返回包含 ``y_hat``、``y_label``、``y_predict`` 的字典。以 GIKT 为例："
msgstr ""
"``forward_pass`` returns a dict containing ``y_hat``, ``y_label``, and "
"``y_predict``. Using GIKT as an example:"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:110 15dab007c41046f09e197bb0f7c56046
msgid "BaseTrainer 提供的关键辅助方法："
msgstr "Key helper methods provided by BaseTrainer:"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:80 0249263f0680442c97aae426c0aab13f
msgid "方法"
msgstr "Method"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:80 bee301c2f09545c6a1b60d4852385ee8
msgid "作用"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:80 f8380f95005c4de28d2481afda9020ec
msgid "``_move_tensor_to_device(t)``"
msgstr "``_move_tensor_to_device(t)``"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:80 7a82272fedce47999abf428ae7d5baad
msgid "张量移到训练设备"
msgstr "Move a tensor to the training device"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:80 48d0c7269dc246bb8e5345bcc07d2a39
msgid "``_extract_valid_predictions(y, r, m)``"
msgstr "``_extract_valid_predictions(y, r, m)``"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:80 d190e7011726454e9951c8d1e5d444ef
msgid "next-item 对齐：``y[:,:-1]`` 配 ``r[:,1:]``"
msgstr "next-item alignment: ``y[:,:-1]`` paired with ``r[:,1:]``"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:80 e1ff3f5a9af545fc803700700615bdb1
msgid "``_pad_to_full_sequence(y)``"
msgstr "``_pad_to_full_sequence(y)``"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:80 3c933e9156944436be9bd01aa3ec37ad
msgid "``[B,S-1]`` 补零到 ``[B,S]``，用于输出缺末位的模型"
msgstr ""
"Zero-pad ``[B,S-1]`` to ``[B,S]`` for models whose output lacks the last "
"position"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:80 73ca383963d34f92bd61a922f63cf7fb
msgid "``_handle_empty_batch(yh, yl)``"
msgstr "``_handle_empty_batch(yh, yl)``"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:80 347cb1d50d7d45cba40376c77f98bf3a
msgid "空 batch 安全检查（抛 ValueError 防止静默失败）"
msgstr ""
"Empty-batch safety check (raises ValueError to prevent silent failures)"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:80 a973bf95d5044ec2885e810e126e3c79
msgid "``_generate_binary_predictions(y, t)``"
msgstr "``_generate_binary_predictions(y, t)``"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:80 1f3d6bc1045b4b5cab7482cf5af04acb
msgid "二分类预测"
msgstr "Binary classification predictions"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:121 3ab2b6dd913d4c7cb1dea0eca77c5dc5
msgid "步骤三：用装饰器注册"
msgstr "Step 3: Register with a decorator"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:123 01ff613e3e2c401f9124cbd525e9fbb8
msgid "在 Trainer 和参数配置类上方添加装饰器："
msgstr "Add decorators above the trainer and parameter configuration classes:"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:149 1d878d030df342c5b6e8f9df285018ad
msgid "注册后直接运行 ``python train.py -m MyModel -d assistments09``。"
msgstr ""
"After registration, run ``python train.py -m MyModel -d assistments09`` "
"directly."

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:152 18e6965d46cb47a18abebc4b32ce17f4
msgid "装饰器参数必须是**字符串字面量**，变量或表达式不会被识别。"
msgstr ""
"The decorator argument must be a **string literal**; variables or "
"expressions are not recognized."

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:155 119d9b1e655141bcacfa552d6ed60c15
msgid "步骤四：预测位提取"
msgstr "Step 4: Prediction-position extraction"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:157 5ebc93c1d4ac4e4ab2c29b1486bd12f9
msgid ""
"UniKT 通过 ``_extract_valid_predictions`` 自动从模型输出中提取有效的预测位置，确保 ``y_hat[t]``"
" 对齐到正确的 ``response`` 标签。支持两种输出约定："
msgstr ""
"UniKT automatically extracts valid prediction positions from the model "
"output via ``_extract_valid_predictions``, ensuring that ``y_hat[t]`` is "
"aligned to the correct ``response`` label. Two output conventions are "
"supported:"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:159 72e4109e44e94cdba730be7a1db48411
msgid ""
"**约定 A：next-item（默认）** — ``y_hat_full[t]`` 预测 ``response[t+1]``。GIKT、AKT "
"采用此约定："
msgstr ""
"**Convention A: next-item (default)** — ``y_hat_full[t]`` predicts "
"``response[t+1]``. GIKT and AKT use this convention:"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:165 dde5cbb1951d40a9848635feba6f24a5
msgid "若模型只输出 ``[B, S-1]``，先用 ``_pad_to_full_sequence`` 补零。"
msgstr ""
"If the model only outputs ``[B, S-1]``, zero-pad it first with "
"``_pad_to_full_sequence``."

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:167 8fa44650d8514612a699e836182eb331
msgid ""
"**约定 B：same-position** — ``y_hat_full[t]`` 预测 ``response[t]``。SimpleKT "
"采用此约定，传入 ``same_position=True``，内部自动左移一位（丢弃无历史的第 0 位）以遵守 next-item 契约。"
msgstr ""
"**Convention B: same-position** — ``y_hat_full[t]`` predicts "
"``response[t]``. SimpleKT uses this convention; pass "
"``same_position=True`` and it is internally shifted left by one (dropping "
"position 0, which has no history) to satisfy the next-item contract."

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:169 9203150c03d54367a9e10c92bde248d1
msgid "检查清单"
msgstr "Checklist"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:171 11fd0993e32c44828505ec16610761b2
msgid ""
"☐ ``forward_pass`` 中模型输入**不含当前题目的 response**（``r[t]`` 不在 ``y_hat[t]`` "
"的计算路径）"
msgstr ""
"☐ The model input in ``forward_pass`` **does not include the current "
"question's response** (``r[t]`` is not on the computation path of "
"``y_hat[t]``)"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:172 7c86302348e646d8ad5912bd8eaf3a07
msgid "☐ ``response[:, 0]`` 的含义与模型约定一致"
msgstr "☐ The meaning of ``response[:, 0]`` matches the model convention"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:173 fcf0401ec29b4d1d8e90967c22f2fb7e
msgid "☐ 若模型内部做移位，确认方向正确（``r[t-1]`` 而非 ``r[t+1]``）"
msgstr ""
"☐ If the model shifts internally, verify the direction is correct "
"(``r[t-1]`` not ``r[t+1]``)"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:174 28249cf4d0d34827b47162d9e6620895
msgid "☐ 打一次 ``y_hat.shape`` vs ``response.shape``，确认时序对齐"
msgstr ""
"☐ Print ``y_hat.shape`` vs ``response.shape`` once to confirm temporal "
"alignment"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:175 47424615f36143eb8e9f378d4d411c7c
msgid "☐ Windowlate 评估时确认 ``response`` 占位值不影响预测"
msgstr ""
"☐ During windowed evaluation, confirm the ``response`` placeholder values do "
"not affect predictions"

#: ../../source/user-guide/new-model.md:177 7adc79a9afc8456c8c4aa8c711e0cba8
msgid "步骤五：运行验证"
msgstr "Step 5: Run verification"

